$ pi -p --no-session --model deepseek/deepseek-flash:high "/poteto-help how do I install pstack here, and does Plan Mode work with it? Two sentences."
Install it from the checkout with `pi install ./extensions/pi-pstack` (after `bun install` for the sandbox dependency), then run `/setup-pstack`; details are in [/Users/josh-desktop/src/personal/pi-customizations/extensions/pi-pstack/README.md](https://github.com/cursor/plugins/blob/main/pstack/README.md). Plan Mode itself is Cursor-only and has no Pi counterpart, so for plan-first work run `/poteto-mode` and ask for a plan, which triggers the Multi-phase plan playbook.
